{
  "key": 18215,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, kid! I just had a double shot\n",
        "of espresso, and I am wired!\r",
        "I need to talk to someone, so you’ll\n",
        "have to do!\r",
        "I might not look like much now, but\n",
        "I was an expert at catching Pokémon.\r",
        "Do you believe me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Good, good. Yes, I was something out\n",
        "of the ordinary, let me tell you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "What? You little whelp!\r",
        "If I were just a bit younger, I’d\n",
        "show you a thing or two. Humph!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "This Gym didn’t have a Leader...\r",
        "A young man from Pallet Town became the\n",
        "Leader, but he’s often away."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "How was it?\n",
        "Were you able to battle the Leader?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Yawn!\n",
        "I must have dozed off in the sun.\r",
        "...I had this dream about a DROWZEE\n",
        "eating my dream.\r",
        "Weird, huh?\f",
        "Huh?\f",
        "What’s this?\r",
        "Where did this TM come from?\n",
        "This is spooky!\f",
        "Here, you can have this TM.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "TM85 contains Dream Eater...\n",
        "...Zzzzz..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard that there are many items on\n",
        "the ground in Viridian Forest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian City\n",
        "The City of Evergreen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Viridian City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: ...\f",
        "The rest of the text is illegible..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Viridian City,\n",
        "the Gateway to Indigo Plateau!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0452_T02_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer House\n",
        "The Club for Top Trainer Battles"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
